xcuserdata/
build/
Externals/
# Build products of `tauri ios build`/`dev`. `assets/` is the frontend dist
# copied in for the resources phase (project.yml: path: assets); a copy of the
# built webview bundle, not authored content.
assets/

# CocoaPods' checkout. `Podfile` is generated by `tauri ios init` and tracked;
# what `pod install` fetches into `Pods/` is somebody else's source, restored
# by a command. Nothing puts it here today — Paper has no pod dependencies —
# and the rule is here so that the day one arrives, it does not arrive in a
# commit.
Pods/
